"text": "Figure AI received multiple rounds of high‑value financing, including a major round around February 25, 2024 involving OpenAI as an investor, leading to
a valuation exceeding approximately 2.6 billion USD despite being less than two years old, and is frequently described as a star company in the embodied 
intelligence and humanoid robot domain.", "source_ids": ["20260629134533493622_15f5d554", "20260629134533541126_7f5cc0d7"], "citations": [1, 2], "sources": 
