"text": "1X Technologies focuses its product roadmap on embodied security robots and humanoid‑form robots, primarily for security, monitoring, guarding, and 
patrolling scenarios, and emphasizes safety and stability more strongly in its control strategy than some other general‑purpose humanoid robot firms.", 
"source_ids": ["20260629134533493622_15f5d554", "20260629134533699564_aef28037"], "citations": [1, 6], "sources": [{"source_id": "20260629134533493622_15f5d554",
