"source_type": "blog", "published_at": null}]}, {"id": "20260629135617889315_16bf6978", "type": "Claim", "text": "1X Technologies applies a data‑driven control 
strategy that combines visual perception with large‑model‑based decision‑making to control its security robots, aligning with OpenAI’s vision of bringing general
AI models into the physical world.", "source_ids": ["20260629134533493622_15f5d554", "20260629134533580677_9519aa45"], "citations": [1, 3], "sources": 
[{"source_id": "20260629134533493622_15f5d554", "title": "OpenAI已投出两家具身智能领域独角兽公司!", "url": "https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/40857", "source_type": 
