2024, 1X’s humanoid security robots had entered testing and early commercial deployment, while Tesla’s Optimus was in internal factory trial operation and Figure
01 was conducting pilot demonstrations in warehouse and manufacturing scenarios, indicating that representative embodied‑intelligence humanoid systems were in 
prototype and limited deployment stages rather than broad commercialization.", "source_ids": ["20260629134533580677_9519aa45", "20260629134533662349_45f627b5"], 
