"20260629135618260273_3d5141d9", "type": "Claim", "text": "OpenAI provides both investment and technical model support to embodied‑intelligence and 
humanoid‑robot companies such as Figure AI and 1X Technologies, including leading a 23.5 million USD A2 round for 1X in March 2023 and contributing models within
a later major financing and strategic collaboration with Figure.", "source_ids": ["20260629134533493622_15f5d554", "20260629134533541126_7f5cc0d7", 
