"20260629135618619530_9a265f33", "type": "Claim", "text": "Analyst and industry articles in 2024–2025 regard Figure AI, 1X Technologies, and Tesla as 
representative companies in the general‑purpose humanoid robot track, with Figure and 1X highlighted as core players that have received funding at the 
hundreds‑of‑millions‑of‑USD level amid a broader surge in embodied‑intelligence financing.", "source_ids": ["20260629134533580677_9519aa45", 
"20260629134533699564_aef28037"], "citations": [3, 6], "sources": [{"source_id": "20260629134533580677_9519aa45", "title": "2025年人形机器人产业深度解析- 
