"published_at": null}]}, {"id": "20260629135618949023_de89d59f", "type": "Claim", "text": "Several research and market reports published for 2024–2025 focus 
explicitly on embodied intelligence and humanoid robots, analyzing technical architectures, grading embodied‑intelligence systems (e.g., G1–G5 levels, with most 
systems assessed at G2 moving toward G3 by late 2024), and reviewing product status, technical routes, iteration plans, and supply‑chain structures of 
representative companies likely including OpenAI‑related projects, Figure, and 1X.", "source_ids": ["20260629134533616209_65a0b8cc", 
