anticipated commercialization boom year, with some commentators expecting 2026 to be widely viewed as the start of large‑scale commercial deployment and the 
appearance of humanoid products priced as low as 99,000 RMB.", "source_ids": ["20260629134533580677_9519aa45", "20260629134533662349_45f627b5", 
"20260629134533699564_aef28037"], "citations": [3, 5, 6], "sources": [{"source_id": "20260629134533580677_9519aa45", "title": "2025年人形机器人产业深度解析- 
