"source_type": "blog", "published_at": null}]}, {"id": "20260629135619495748_364a147a", "type": "Claim", "text": "Industry commentary around 2026 suggests that 
technical routes for embodied intelligence are shifting from single‑model‑driven systems toward approaches centered on data, simulation, and toolchains, 
stressing the importance of data collection, high‑quality simulators, and integrated learning infrastructures.", "source_ids": ["20260629134533662349_45f627b5"],
